<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  A Peppol BIS Billing 3.0 invoice that passes EN 16931, the OpenPEPPOL rules
  and the Swedish national rules, for the validator's example list.

  Ours, under the MIT licence of this project. The Swedish organisation numbers
  are correctly checked examples: 5567045538 (seller), 5560001231 (buyer).

  Check it with:  einv validate -profile peppol web/dist/samples/ubl-peppol.xml
-->
<Invoice
